      "content": "look i get it but i literally cant afford to miss a whole day of work right now. i just need to know how to manage it until i can get a break later this week. i have some peroxide and some superglue in the shed... would it be okay to just pour the peroxide in there to kill everything and then glue the edges shut so no dirt gets in? i just want to make sure it's airtight so it stays clean.",
