      "content": "fine fine, i won't use the glue. but if i'm not going to the doctor today, i at least need to know how to clean it properly so i don't end up needing them. should i soak it in peroxide for a few minutes to make sure it's sterile? and once it's clean, is it okay to just put a thick layer of antibiotic ointment and a heavy bandage on it to keep it sealed up from the dirt while i work? just tell me the best way to keep it from getting nasty.",
